{"id":"d076e1632215bc37","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-forcing12-forcing-axiom-instance.md","title":"ZFC Forcing12 Forcing Axiom Instance","display":"df-zfc-forcing12-forcing-axiom-instance — ZFC Forcing12 Forcing Axiom Instance","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-forcing-axiom-instance","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing12-forcing-axiom-instance"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing12-forcing-axiom-instance — ZFC Forcing12 Forcing Axiom Instance","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-forcing-axiom-instance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing12-forcing-axiom-instance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing12-forcing-axiom-instance — ZFC Forcing12 Forcing Axiom Instance"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (forcing poset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\">\\(\\leq_P\\)</span> (forcing order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_P\">\\(1_P\\)</span> (top condition)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span> (family of dense subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (size bound)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (directed upward-closed subset meeting <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> (member of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\)</span> (forcing-poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ForcingAxiomInstance}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ForcingAxiomInstance}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}instance} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ForcingAxiomInstance}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\mathcal D,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(P)\\land|\\mathcal D|&lt;\\kappa\\land\\left[\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\leq_Pp)\\right]\\land\\exists G\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl(G\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall p,q\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in G\\;(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pq)\\land\\forall p\\in G\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;(p\\leq_Pq\\to q\\in G)\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;(G\\cap D\\neq\\varnothing)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}instance} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ForcingAxiomInstance}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\mathcal D,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(P)\\land|\\mathcal D|&lt;\\kappa\\land\\left[\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\leq_Pp)\\right]\\land\\exists G\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl(G\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall p,q\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in G\\;(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pq)\\land\\forall p\\in G\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;(p\\leq_Pq\\to q\\in G)\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;(G\\cap D\\neq\\varnothing)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The forcing-poset atom permits preorders, whereas the generic poset-filter atom additionally demands antisymmetry.  Expanding the directedness and upward-closure clauses avoids silently restricting the forcing notion, and explicit brackets keep the density quantifiers outside the existential witness clause.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S$ (forcing-poset predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P","display":false},{"tex":"1_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ForcingAxiomInstance}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}instance} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ForcingAxiomInstance}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\mathcal D,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(P)\\land|\\mathcal D|<\\kappa\\land\\left[\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\leq_Pp)\\right]\\land\\exists G\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl(G\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall p,q\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in G\\;(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pq)\\land\\forall p\\in G\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;(p\\leq_Pq\\to q\\in G)\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;(G\\cap D\\neq\\varnothing)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1924,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2043","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-forcing12-forcing-axiom-instance.md|58-df-zfc-forcing12-forcing-axiom-instance]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","b5833df5ef175153","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}